<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4107" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, 
			Ion.
		, =
		
			Att.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁθρόος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thronged, crowded, in a mass</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὰ ἁλέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.133
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ἁλέες εἴησαν οἱ Ἕλληνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.104
			</span></i>, al.: sg. with collective nouns, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁ. γενομένη πᾶσα ἡ Ἑλλάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					7.157
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁ. ἐὼν ὁ στρατός</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				236
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁ. τροφή, αἷμα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				2.45
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.4
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έως</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.36
			</span></i>: neut. pl.as Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκχέουσιν τὸ οὖρον ἁλέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SD</u>
					2.2
				</span></i>
			. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				86
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλέα λέσχην</span> is
				v.l.
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				493
			</span></i>.] (<i>sṃ</i>-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝαλής</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝαλῆναι</span>.)</div>
